{"strongs": "H5081", "word": "נָדִיב", "translit": "na.div", "root": "נגל", "morph": "H:N", "pos": "adjective", "gloss": "inclined, generous, noble", "definition": "נָדִיב adjective and noun masculine Isa 32:8 inclined, generous, noble ; — absolute ׳ נ Isa 32:5 + 6 t.; construct נְדִיב Exod 35:5 + 2 t.; feminine נְדִיבָה Ps 51:4 plural נְדִיבִים Isa 13:2 + 9 t.; construct נְדִיבֵי Num 21:18 + 2 t.; suffix נְדִיבֵמוֺ Ps 83:12 — 1. incited, inclined, willing , נְדִיב לֵב Exod 35:5 ; Exod 35:22 ( P ), 1Chr 29:31 (see נָדַב Qal ), נָדִיב בְחָכְמָה 1Chr 28:21 רוּחַ נְדִיבָה Ps 51:14 a willing spirit. 2. noble, princely , in rank 1Sam 2:8 (poem), Job 12:21 = Ps 107:40 ; Job 34:18 ; Prov 8:16 ; Ps 47:10 ; Ps 83:12 ; Ps 113:8 (twice in verse); Ps 118:9 ; Ps 146:3 פְּנֵי נדיב Prov 19:6 ; Prov 25:7 ׳ בית נ Job 21:28 ׳ פתחי נ Isa 13:2 ׳ בת נ Song 7:2 נְדִיבֵי הָעָם Num 21:18 (poem). 3. noble in mind and character || צדּיק Prov 17:26 opposed to נָבָל Isa 32:5 ; Isa 32:8 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4988')\">BDB4988</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H5081')\">H5081</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4987')\">BDB4987</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4989')\">BDB4989</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>נָדִיב</bdbheb> <b>adjective</b> and <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Isa 32:8\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(23,32,8)\">Isa 32:8</ref></sup> <highlightword>inclined, generous, noble</highlightword>; — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 32:5\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(23,32,5)\">Isa 32:5</ref> + 6 t.; construct <bdbheb>נְדִיב</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 35:5\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(2,35,5)\">Exod 35:5</ref> + 2 t.; feminine <bdbheb>נְדִיבָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 51:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,51,4)\">P